This is a repository to test single layer Compton cameras a short distances from the source.

Code to simulate compton cameras differs according to Gate version:
- First module dedicated to compton cameras appeared in Gate 9.2 (see CCMod paper)
- Gate 9.3 introduced a new way to handle digitizers
- Gate 10 completely changed, scripts are now in python and compton camera actors have not been re-implemented (yet?)